  "scope_note": {
    "zh": "范围为智谱中国区BigModel标准托管API的文本/推理/编程与视觉语言理解型号；available表示当前官方目录或请求枚举登记，不是本账户实时可用或已实测。仅记录有官方准确API ID依据的型号，不由展示名造ID，不继承同系列参数、能力或验证。覆盖当前主要目录及有确切ID的部分往期/转路由/退役记录，并非账户动态全量清单；仅旧价目不足以确认可用性。免费型号仅用于目录，不改变本仓库付费默认与示例。排除图像/视频生成、语音/实时音视频、embedding/rerank、纯OCR与私有部署专属型号；输入模态仅按本schema列text/image/video，文件容器及协议细节不在此展开。CodeGeeX-4等仅有展示名称而未确认准确托管ID的条目未猜测补入；GLM-Z1其它变体同理。价格仅提供官方链接，无数字快照；地区、账户权限与生命周期以官方实时信息为准。",
    "en": "Scope: BigModel's China-region standard hosted text, reasoning, coding and vision-language APIs. Available means listed in current official catalog/request enums, not live account access or successful testing. Only officially evidenced exact API IDs are recorded; display names do not generate IDs, and family parameters, capabilities or verification are not inherited. Coverage includes current major entries plus some exact older, routed and retired IDs, not a dynamic account-wide inventory; historical pricing alone does not establish availability. Free entries are catalog-only and do not change this repository's paid defaults/examples. Excludes image/video generation, speech/realtime audiovisual services, embeddings/reranking, OCR-only and private-deployment-only models. Modalities are limited by this schema to text/image/video; file containers and protocol details are not expanded. Display-only entries such as CodeGeeX-4, and other GLM-Z1 variants without separately confirmed hosted IDs, are not guessed. Prices are linked without numeric snapshots; region, entitlement and lifecycle remain subject to current official information."
  },
